---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'; import Header from '../components/Header.astro'; import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro'; import Recommend from '../components/Recommend.astro';
---
<Layout title="무료 QR코드 생성기 | URL QR 만들기 | ManyTool" description="URL, 텍스트, 연락처를 입력해 무료 QR코드를 만들어보세요." keywords="QR코드 만들기, QR 생성기, 무료 QR코드"><Header /><main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-8"><section class="rounded-[28px] bg-slate-950 p-6 text-white sm:p-8"><p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan-300">Generator</p><h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black sm:text-4xl">무료 QR코드 생성기</h1><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">링크나 문장을 입력하면 바로 사용할 수 있는 QR코드를 만듭니다.</p></section><section class="mt-6 rounded-[28px] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 text-center shadow-sm"><textarea id="text" rows="4" placeholder="https://manytool.net" class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-slate-300 p-4 text-left"></textarea><button id="run" class="mt-5 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-500 px-5 py-3 font-bold">QR코드 만들기</button><div id="result" class="mt-6"></div></section><Recommend /></main><Footer /></Layout>
<script is:inline>const t=document.getElementById('text'),o=document.getElementById('result');document.getElementById('run').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(!t.value.trim()){o.textContent='내용을 입력해주세요.';return}const src=`https://api.qrserver.com/v1/create-qr-code/?size=400x400&data=${encodeURIComponent(t.value)}`;o.innerHTML=`<img src="${src}" alt="생성된 QR코드" class="mx-auto h-64 w-64 rounded-xl border p-2"/><a href="${src}" download="manytool-qr.png" target="_blank" class="mt-4 inline-block rounded-xl bg-slate-950 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white">QR 이미지 열기</a>`});</script>
